{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/860c305ad31805faa600599fbe4dc5b9.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=887 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Dog 1, from renowned indie BL developer Tennenouji, is finally available in English! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They've only got one shot to get back on top. Good thing luck is on their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with the slam of a prison door. Four captains from the same Mafia family, the CR:5, are taken out in one fell swoop and left to rot behind bars\u2014\u2014but they're in luck because our hero, Gian, is already there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Gian's normally just a run-of-the-mill wiseguy doing petty jobs for the family while he's on the outside and taking it easy while he's in the slammer, that all changes when he gets a call from the boss: if he can break the captains out, he'll be rewarded with a spot at the top of the hierarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he pull off a job this big, or is it more than even Gian's fabled good luck can manage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/b3f385a0a9cf90317d10c47223d2b065.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With everything from prison breaks, going on the lamb, conflicts with rival gangs and four fellow criminals to pursue passionate (uncensored!) relations with, you're in for a real thrill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.poster.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.webm?t=1773221509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.mp4?t=1773221509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully voiced and several voices that are sure to sound <i>awfully familiar</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/808c6e28010d8ac330c643a53d5b0d02.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flagship title of indie BL game developer, Tennenouji. Written by Jinnai (founder of Kalmia8, director of Fashioning Little Miss Lonesome and Fxxx Me Royally!!) with stylish art by Yura (Hana Awase, Absolute Obedience, Enzai).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815890?t=1773221509","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/a6aa278b46e6146c83fb93c6ee2995f32f90c37e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773221509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/9ce352b844bbcee2b1f046c80395ba6c5c51cc97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773221509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/9ce352b844bbcee2b1f046c80395ba6c5c51cc97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773221509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This title is designed for adult (18+) audiences only. The content of this game may not be suitable for all people. \r\n\r\nThis game contains fictional representations of the following: violence, death, blood, killing, torture, criminal acts.  This game also contains sexual content including body scarring, bruising, bleeding, nudity, sexual interactions including consensual & non-consensual sex, oral sex, and clear depictions of genitalia & bodily fluids. All players of this story should be functionally resilient to potential stressors such as depictions of tobacco consumption and crude language. \r\n\r\nThis game is designed purely as a work of fiction, please play responsibly."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/860c305ad31805faa600599fbe4dc5b9.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=887 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Dog 1, from renowned indie BL developer Tennenouji, is finally available in English! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They've only got one shot to get back on top. Good thing luck is on their side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with the slam of a prison door. Four captains from the same Mafia family, the CR:5, are taken out in one fell swoop and left to rot behind bars\u2014\u2014but they're in luck because our hero, Gian, is already there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Gian's normally just a run-of-the-mill wiseguy doing petty jobs for the family while he's on the outside and taking it easy while he's in the slammer, that all changes when he gets a call from the boss: if he can break the captains out, he'll be rewarded with a spot at the top of the hierarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he pull off a job this big, or is it more than even Gian's fabled good luck can manage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/b3f385a0a9cf90317d10c47223d2b065.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With everything from prison breaks, going on the lamb, conflicts with rival gangs and four fellow criminals to pursue passionate (uncensored!) relations with, you're in for a real thrill!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.poster.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.webm?t=1773221509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/60607f9b149a320993b43e2992b5a6a8.mp4?t=1773221509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully voiced and several voices that are sure to sound <i>awfully familiar</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/extras/808c6e28010d8ac330c643a53d5b0d02.avif?t=1773221509\" width=780 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flagship title of indie BL game developer, Tennenouji. Written by Jinnai (founder of Kalmia8, director of Fashioning Little Miss Lonesome and Fxxx Me Royally!!) with stylish art by Yura (Hana Awase, Absolute Obedience, Enzai).</p>","developers":["tennenouji"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815890/51841d1f130ad3632d818ca0e8f1dbaffca2e999/header.jpg?t=1773221509","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 WoGa / Tennenouji / MangaGamer","linux